How it reaches each platform:

  - Android — the official Google artifact
    `com.google.ai.edge.litertlm:litertlm-android`, resolved by Gradle at build time.
    Not redistributed by this repository.
  - iOS — prebuilt arm64 dylibs (libLiteRtLm, libGemmaModelConstraintProvider,
    libLiteRtMetalAccelerator, libStreamProxy), fetched by AIiOS/download_frameworks.sh
    and rewrapped as xcframeworks so Xcode can embed and sign them. The binaries
    themselves are unmodified; only their packaging changes. These are currently sourced
    from a third-party redistribution (the flutter_gemma project's release assets) rather
    than from Google directly — permitted under the Apache 2.0 license, and noted here
    for provenance.

